Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.84,0:00:04.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[GROANS]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.59,0:00:12.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[CONTINUES GROANING]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.81,0:00:16.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.81,0:00:16.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.77,0:00:18.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-This is Thai food. -Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.77,0:00:18.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-这是泰国菜 -又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.35,0:00:23.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We don't have Thai food on Thursday. We have pizza on Thursday.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.35,0:00:23.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们星期四不吃泰国菜的 而是吃比萨
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.44,0:00:26.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, but we all agreed the third Thursday of every month...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.44,0:00:26.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错 但我们讲好了 每月的第三个星期四
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.32,0:00:28.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...would be Anything Can Happen Thursday.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.32,0:00:28.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是〝充满惊奇的星期四〞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.49,0:00:31.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The news didn't reach my digestive system which, when startled...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.49,0:00:31.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的消化系统没收到讯息 它受惊了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.78,0:00:34.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...has its own version of Anything Can Happen Thursday.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.78,0:00:34.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在我的肠胃在给我惊奇
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.24,0:00:39.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The whole idea behind Anything Can Happen Thursday...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.24,0:00:39.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}〝充满惊奇〞的真谛就是…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.08,0:00:41.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...is to get out of this rut we've been in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.08,0:00:41.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}跳脱我们的刻板生活
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.21,0:00:44.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Rut? I think you mean consistency.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.21,0:00:44.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}刻板？你是说坚定持久吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:47.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And if we're going to abandon that, why even call it Thursday?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:47.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果要抛开规矩 又何必称它〝星期四〞？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.05,0:00:51.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let's call it "Quonko Day" and divide it into 29 hours of 17 minutes a piece...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.05,0:00:51.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}干脆称它〝混乱日〞分成二十九小时 一小时十七分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.72,0:00:55.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and celebrate it by sacrificing a goat to the mighty god Ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.72,0:00:55.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}举行庆典宰羊献祭给埃及太阳神
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.31,0:00:59.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I could go for some goat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.31,0:00:59.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}山羊肉还不错
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.14,0:01:04.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, we agreed we'd do something different tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.14,0:01:04.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 我们讲好了 今晚要来点不一样的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.65,0:01:07.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right. Let's go to the comic book store.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.65,0:01:07.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 我们去漫画书店
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.44,0:01:09.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We went to the comic book store last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.44,0:01:09.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}昨晚才去过
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.57,0:01:12.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Last night was Wednesday. Wednesday is comic-book night.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.57,0:01:12.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}昨晚是星期三 星期三本来就是漫画夜
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.32,0:01:17.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We'll be going on Thursday because it's Anything Can Happen Thursday.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.32,0:01:17.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}今晚去就变成星期四去了 星期四就是要〝充满惊奇〞
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.24,0:01:22.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Way to think outside but pressed right up against the box, Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.24,0:01:22.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}虽然跳出框架思考 其实还紧靠着框架外围
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.58,0:01:24.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What are we gonna do tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.58,0:01:24.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那到底要怎样？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.17,0:01:26.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If I may proffer a suggestion...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.17,0:01:26.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}请容我提出建议
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.54,0:01:31.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...in bars all across this great nation of ours, Thursday night is Ladies' Night.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.54,0:01:31.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}全国各地的酒吧 都把星期四订为〝淑女之夜〞
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.72,0:01:34.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}As the evening progresses, we will get better-looking...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.72,0:01:34.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以夜越深 我们会变更帅
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.80,0:01:37.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...courtesy of 99-cent margaritas and two-for-one Jell-O shots.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.80,0:01:37.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为调酒特价 烈酒买二送一
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.02,0:01:45.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on, Howard, the odds of us picking up girls in a bar are practically zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.02,0:01:45.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}死心吧 霍华德 我们去酒吧 追到女生的机率是零
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.31,0:01:47.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh. Really? Are you familiar with the Drake equation?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.31,0:01:47.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是吗？你知道〝德雷克公式〞吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.77,0:01:50.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The one that estimates the odds of contact with extraterrestrials...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.77,0:01:50.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}计算和外星生物接触的机率
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.61,0:01:53.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...by calculating the product of series of fractional values...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.61,0:01:53.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}借由计算一连串摩擦值的产物
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.53,0:01:55.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...such as stars with planets likely to develop life?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.53,0:01:55.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}例如有行星并 较有可能有生物的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.12,0:02:00.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}N equals R times FP times NE times FL times FI times FC times L?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.12,0:02:00.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}N等于R乘以FP乘以NE乘以FL 乘以FI乘以FC乘以L
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.29,0:02:05.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.29,0:02:05.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 就是那个
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.21,0:02:14.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You can modify it to calculate our chances of having sex...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.21,0:02:14.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}修改一下就能算出我们艳遇的机率
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.72,0:02:17.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...by changing the formula to use single women in Los Angeles...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.72,0:02:17.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只要改用洛杉矶单身女子人数
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.85,0:02:19.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...those who might find us attractive...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.85,0:02:19.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}会觉得我们迷人的女子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.89,0:02:23.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and what I call The Wolowitz Coefficient.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.89,0:02:23.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我称它〝沃洛维茨系数〞
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.02,0:02:28.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-The Wolowitz Coefficient? -Neediness times dress-size squared.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.02,0:02:28.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-〝沃洛维茨系数〞？ -饥渴乘以裙子尺码平方
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.90,0:02:34.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In crunching the numbers, I come up with a conservative 5812 potential sex partners...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.90,0:02:34.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}辛苦计算后保守估计 有五千八百一十二个潜在性伴侣
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.32,0:02:35.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...within a 40-mile radius.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.32,0:02:35.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在方圆60公里内
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.24,0:02:37.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.24,0:02:37.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}开玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.57,0:02:41.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm a horny engineer, Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.57,0:02:41.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是性饥渴的工程师 莱纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.41,0:02:43.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I never joke about math or sex.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.41,0:02:43.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不开数学和性爱的玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.58,0:02:48.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, what are we waiting for? Let's bounce, bitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.58,0:02:48.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那还等什么？出发吧 骚货们
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.42,0:02:53.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, you're right. It's Anything Can Happen Thursday.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.42,0:02:53.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错 今天是〝充满惊奇的星期四〞
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.59,0:02:55.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let's hit the clubs and meet hot women.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.59,0:02:55.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们去夜店找辣妹吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.59,0:02:59.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here we go. Lock up your daughters. We're gonna hit it and quit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.59,0:02:59.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}狼来了 快把女儿关起来 否则我们吃到了就跑
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.64,0:03:08.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Or we could finish eating and go to the comic book store.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.64,0:03:08.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或者我们把饭吃完然后去漫画店
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.44,0:03:11.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Also a good plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.44,0:03:11.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这样也不赖
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.94,0:03:14.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But next Anything Can Happen Thursday, we're going to a bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.94,0:03:14.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但下个〝充满惊奇的星期四〞 我们一定要去酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.03,0:03:17.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Oh, absolutely. -You heard that, Ladies' Night ladies?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.03,0:03:17.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-那当然 -听见没？〝淑女之夜〞的淑女们
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.74,0:03:20.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're eventually coming for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.74,0:03:20.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们终究会来找你们
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.54,0:03:25.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.54,0:03:25.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太精彩了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.81,0:03:53.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Oh, hey, guys. Where you headed? -To the comic book store.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.81,0:03:53.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你们好 上哪儿去？ -漫画书店
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.57,0:03:56.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're thinking, "The comic book store on a Thursday?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.57,0:03:56.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你或许纳闷〝星期四去漫画书店？〞
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.74,0:03:59.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why, I've fallen down the rabbit hole and into a land of madness."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.74,0:03:59.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}〝我有如爱丽丝梦游仙境 到了疯狂的世界〞
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.99,0:04:05.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What you have failed to take into account is that this is Anything Can Happen Thursday.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.99,0:04:05.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但你忘了纳入考量 今天是〝充满惊奇的星期四〞
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.50,0:04:08.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.50,0:04:08.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}果然很惊奇
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.16,0:04:11.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, hey, could you pick me up a few comics for my nephew's birthday?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.16,0:04:11.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可以顺便帮我买一些漫画吗？ 我要送侄子生日礼物
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.46,0:04:13.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I think you mean comic books.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.46,0:04:13.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是说〝漫画书〞吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.63,0:04:15.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Comics are feeble attempts at humor...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.63,0:04:15.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}〝漫画〞是薄弱的幽默
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.67,0:04:18.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...featuring talking babies and anthropomorphized pets...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.67,0:04:18.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}用会说话的婴儿和拟人化的宠物
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.63,0:04:23.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...found traditionally in the optimistically named "funny pages."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.63,0:04:23.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}登载在报章杂志 自诩为〝博君一笑〞的版面
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.56,0:04:26.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard, pick me up comics for my nephew's birthday?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.56,0:04:26.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德 帮我侄子挑一些漫画好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.48,0:04:29.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Sure. What does he like? -I don't know, just pick out anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.48,0:04:29.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-好 他喜欢什么？ -不知道 他十三岁 随你挑
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.73,0:04:32.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just pick out anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.73,0:04:32.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}随他挑？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.81,0:04:36.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe we can pick out a new suit for him without knowing his size...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.81,0:04:36.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许我们也可以不问他尺码 就帮他买一套西装
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.40,0:04:39.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...or pick out his career without knowing his aptitude...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.40,0:04:39.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或不知他的资质就帮他选定职业
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.24,0:04:43.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...or pick out a new breakfast cereal without knowing his fiber requirements...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.24,0:04:43.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不知他对纤维的需求 就帮他挑选早餐麦片
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.74,0:04:47.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...or his feelings about little marshmallows.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.74,0:04:47.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不顾他喜不喜欢小棉花糖
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.41,0:04:50.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Spider-Man. Get him Spider-Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.41,0:04:50.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}《蜘蛛侠》 买《蜘蛛侠》
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.29,0:04:53.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Amazing Spider-Man, Ultimate Spider-Man, Spectacular Spider-Man...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.29,0:04:53.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}《超凡蜘蛛侠》？《终极蜘蛛侠》？ 《神奇蜘蛛侠》？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.42,0:04:57.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...The Marvelous Adventures of Spider-Man, Spider-Man 2099?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.42,0:04:57.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}《蜘蛛侠的奇幻历险》？ 《蜘蛛侠2099》？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.63,0:04:59.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Leonard? LEONARD: This can go on all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.63,0:04:59.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-莱纳德 -这样扯不完的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.92,0:05:02.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why don't you just come with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.92,0:05:02.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你干脆跟我们去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.34,0:05:05.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ugh. That's what I was trying to avoid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.34,0:05:05.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我拼了命想避免
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.10,0:05:09.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, I forgot Sensational Spider-Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.10,0:05:09.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我差点忘了《精彩蜘蛛侠》
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.40,0:05:15.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, what a cute little store.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.40,0:05:15.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好可爱的小店
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.69,0:05:21.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Everybody's staring at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.69,0:05:21.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大家都盯着我看
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.36,0:05:25.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}LEONARD: Don't worry. They're more scared of you than you are of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.36,0:05:25.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}放心 他们怕你比你怕他们要多
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.79,0:05:28.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Unlikely.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.79,0:05:28.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不太可能
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.87,0:05:32.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here. What about this one for my nephew?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.87,0:05:32.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这本 适合送我侄子吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.08,0:05:35.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-A superb choice. -Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.08,0:05:35.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-万中之选 -太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.50,0:05:38.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, provided he has already read Infinite Crisis and 52...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.50,0:05:38.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}前提是他读过 《无限危机》和《52》
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.80,0:05:42.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and is familiar with the reestablishment of the DC Multiverse.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.80,0:05:42.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}并熟悉〝DC超次元〞的重建
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.76,0:05:45.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh, what's a Multiverse?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.76,0:05:45.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么是〝超次元〞？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.80,0:05:47.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Get her out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.80,0:05:47.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}快把她带走
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.68,0:05:51.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on, I'll help you pick something.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.68,0:05:51.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}来 我来帮你挑
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.48,0:05:55.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's right. She's with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.48,0:05:55.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错 她是和我们来的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.98,0:06:00.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Guys like that are so pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.98,0:06:00.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这种男生真是可悲
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.44,0:06:01.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Tell me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.44,0:06:01.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还用你说
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.32,0:06:05.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ooh, look, a new Batman belt buckle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.32,0:06:05.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你看 新的蝙蝠侠皮带扣
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.28,0:06:09.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, hey, Leonard. I help you find something?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.28,0:06:09.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德 要帮你找什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.49,0:06:12.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, hey, Stuart. This is Penny. She's just looking for some comic books.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.49,0:06:12.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}斯图尔特 这位是佩妮 她想买漫画书
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.62,0:06:16.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, really? Wow. Blink twice if you're here against your will.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.62,0:06:16.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是吗？你若是被逼来的就眨两次眼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.50,0:06:19.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think we're fine, Stuart.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.50,0:06:19.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你忙你的吧 斯图尔特
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.50,0:06:22.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Okay. Let me know if you need anything. -Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.50,0:06:22.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-好 有需要再叫我 -谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.84,0:06:25.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, he seems like a nice guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.84,0:06:25.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他倒像是个不错的人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.09,0:06:28.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You mean for someone who's into comic books?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.09,0:06:27.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（图画小说）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.26,0:06:29.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是指会看漫画的人来说？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.14,0:06:32.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, no, no. I just meant for-- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.14,0:06:32.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不…我只是说…没错
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.64,0:06:36.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just because people appreciate comic books doesn't make them weirdoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.64,0:06:36.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮 喜欢漫画书的人 不一定都是怪胎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.02,0:06:40.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Stuart's a terrific artist. He went to the Rhode Island School of Design.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.02,0:06:40.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}斯图尔特很有艺术才华 他读过罗德岛设计学院
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.98,0:06:45.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, what about the guy in the superhero T-shirt tucked into his sweatpants?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.98,0:06:45.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 穿着超级英雄Ｔ恤 还塞到运动裤里的那位呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.99,0:06:49.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, yeah, that's Captain Sweatpants.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.99,0:06:49.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他是〝运动裤队长〞
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.83,0:06:54.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He doesn't really help the point I'm trying to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.83,0:06:54.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他并不能支持我刚才的论述
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.83,0:06:58.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Got it, got it, got it. -Got it, got it, got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.83,0:06:58.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-有了…有了… -有了…有了…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.58,0:07:01.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Got it, got it, got it. -Got it, got it, got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.58,0:07:01.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-有了…有了… -有了…有了…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.38,0:07:04.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Got it, got it, got it. -Got it, got it, got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.38,0:07:04.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-有了…有了… -有了…有了…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.30,0:07:06.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Got it, got it, got it. -Got it, got it, got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.30,0:07:06.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-有了…有了… -有了…有了…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.05,0:07:10.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Got it, got it, got it. -Got it, got it, got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.05,0:07:10.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-有了…有了… -有了…有了…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.10,0:07:11.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Need it. -Need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.10,0:07:11.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我要！ -我要！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.06,0:07:16.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Let it go, Sheldon. -Why should I let it go? I saw it first.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.06,0:07:16.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-放手 谢尔顿 -我为何要放手？我先看到的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.06,0:07:20.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Yes, but I saw it from the front. -A far less impressive feat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.06,0:07:20.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-对 但是我先看到正面 -那有什么了不起？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.56,0:07:23.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, come on, I need this for my Batman collection.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.56,0:07:23.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托！我的《蝙蝠侠》收藏需要它
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.40,0:07:26.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I need it for my Robin collection. -Rock Paper Scissors Lizard Spock?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.40,0:07:26.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我的《罗宾》收藏需要它 -剪刀石头布看谁赢？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.74,0:07:28.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why would I gamble? It's mine. Let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.74,0:07:28.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我干嘛赌博？这是我的 放手
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.74,0:07:30.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You let go. -No, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.74,0:07:30.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你放手 -你放手
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.41,0:07:33.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Problem? -Yes. He won't let go of my comic book.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.41,0:07:33.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-有麻烦？ -对 他不肯放开我的漫画书
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.20,0:07:35.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-It's my comic book. -Leonard, we need a ruling.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.20,0:07:35.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-这本是我的！ -莱纳德 请你仲裁
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.70,0:07:37.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh, cut it in half?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.70,0:07:37.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}切成两半？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.08,0:07:41.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Excuse me. -Oh, hello again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.08,0:07:41.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-请问 -又见面了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.38,0:07:44.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi. What would you recommend as a present for a 13-year-old boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.38,0:07:44.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你推荐我送十三岁的少年什么礼物？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.76,0:07:47.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A 13-year-old girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.76,0:07:47.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一个十三岁的少女
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.42,0:07:48.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[LAUGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.80,0:07:53.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But if you're dead set on a comic book, try this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.80,0:07:53.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但你若坚持要送漫画 这本不错
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.60,0:07:55.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh. "Hellblazer." What's this about?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.60,0:07:55.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}《驱魔神探》？内容是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.06,0:07:59.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A morally ambiguous confidence man who smokes, has lung cancer...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.06,0:07:59.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一个有道德争议、自信的人 爱抽烟 患肺癌
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.52,0:08:03.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and is tormented by the spirits of the undead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.52,0:08:03.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}受不死恶灵纠缠之苦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.15,0:08:06.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, if that doesn't make me the favorite aunt, I don't know what will.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.15,0:08:06.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}送他这本漫画 我肯定成为他最爱的姑姑
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.57,0:08:11.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is this me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.57,0:08:11.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.58,0:08:13.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Depends. Do you like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.58,0:08:13.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要看你喜不喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.37,0:08:17.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Wow, it's really good. -Yes, that's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.37,0:08:17.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-画得真好 -对 是你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.46,0:08:21.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's so sweet. But what if I didn't like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.46,0:08:21.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你真好 万一我不喜欢呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.00,0:08:25.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It'd still be you, but I'd feel like an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.00,0:08:25.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我还是会承认是你 只是很丢脸
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.42,0:08:29.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't believe it. Stuart's putting the moves on Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.42,0:08:29.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}难以置信 斯图尔特竟对佩妮进攻
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.97,0:08:32.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have got to learn how to draw.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.97,0:08:32.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我一定也要学会画画
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.72,0:08:35.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.72,0:08:35.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.31,0:08:39.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Once again, defeated by your own prurient interests.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.31,0:08:39.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你再度因沉迷色欲害了自己
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.44,0:08:42.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Guys, have you seen Stuart all up in Penny's business over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.44,0:08:42.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}各位 你们有看见 斯图尔特在意淫佩妮吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.81,0:08:46.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nobody's up in anybody's business. Let's just buy our stuff and go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.81,0:08:46.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有谁在意淫谁 我们买完书就走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.07,0:08:50.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, you've got my number. Now give me the picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.07,0:08:50.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}电话号码给你了 画可以送我了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.40,0:08:52.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right. You drive a hard bargain...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.40,0:08:52.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 虽然你条件苛刻
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.70,0:08:57.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-...but here. -All right. So, um, just give me a call.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.70,0:08:57.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-给你 -好 有空打电话给我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.21,0:09:04.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So Leonard, how are you enjoying Anything Can Happen Thursday?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.21,0:09:04.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德 〝充满惊奇的星期四〞还愉快吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.80,0:09:12.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look at that. That's a dent.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.80,0:09:12.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你看 有凹痕
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.14,0:09:16.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you, Howard "Ham-Fisted" Wolowitz.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.14,0:09:16.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}都是霍华德那只猪蹄手弄的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.85,0:09:22.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did you shut the TV off in the middle of the Deep Space Nine...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.85,0:09:22.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}电视正在播映《星际迷航》原创系列
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.90,0:09:27.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...Star Trek: The Original Series "Trouble With Tribbles" crossover episode?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.90,0:09:27.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}和《银河前哨》交叉剧 〝毛球族危机〞你却关电视？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.36,0:09:30.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Apparently so.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.36,0:09:30.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}显然如此
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.28,0:09:33.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you ill?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.28,0:09:33.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你病了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.53,0:09:35.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.53,0:09:35.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.16,0:09:36.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.16,0:09:36.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.87,0:09:40.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then is it fair to say that you're experiencing some emotional turmoil...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.87,0:09:40.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那么容我断言你正历经情感上的混乱
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.41,0:09:43.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...over the events involving Penny earlier this evening?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.41,0:09:43.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}和今天傍晚的佩妮事件有关
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.54,0:09:45.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When did you pick up on that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.54,0:09:45.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你何时发现的？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.79,0:09:50.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A moment ago, you turned off the TV in the middle of the Deep Space Nine...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.79,0:09:50.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}刚才 电视正在播映 《星际迷航》原创系列
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.46,0:09:54.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...Star Trek: The Original Series "Trouble With Tribbles" crossover episode.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.46,0:09:54.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}和《银河前哨》交叉剧 〝毛球族危机〞你却关电视的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.22,0:09:59.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Would you like some advice?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.22,0:09:59.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你需要建议吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.43,0:10:01.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sure, why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.43,0:10:01.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 随便
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.68,0:10:04.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then this is the perfect time to launch a blog...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.68,0:10:04.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}此时你应该开个博客
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.31,0:10:07.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...with an interactive comments section.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.31,0:10:07.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让陌生人来留言给你建议
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.40,0:10:09.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Gee, thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.40,0:10:09.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}多谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.69,0:10:12.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Would you rather I offer my personal insight?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.69,0:10:12.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}难道你要我个人的剖析？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.90,0:10:14.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I don't need any insights.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.90,0:10:14.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不需要别人来剖析
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.95,0:10:18.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just wanna know why Penny's more interested in Stuart than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.95,0:10:18.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只想知道佩妮为何 对斯图尔特比对我有兴趣
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.45,0:10:20.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're practically the same guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.45,0:10:20.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我和他简直一模一样
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.41,0:10:22.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, I disagree.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.41,0:10:22.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 我不认为
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.41,0:10:25.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, Stuart is taller, artistic, self-employed...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.41,0:10:25.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}斯图尔特比你高 有艺术天分 自己创业
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.71,0:10:30.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and, most significantly, he gets 45 percent off comic books.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.71,0:10:30.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}最重要的是 他买漫画可以打五五折
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.68,0:10:38.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're right. I really should be asking strangers on the Internet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.68,0:10:38.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我还是上网问陌生人的意见好了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.60,0:10:42.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My original point.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.60,0:10:42.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我早说了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.98,0:10:47.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Chinese food, vintage video games.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.98,0:10:47.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}中国菜 经典电玩游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.27,0:10:50.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}After the nightmare of Anything Can Happen Thursday...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.27,0:10:50.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在〝充满惊奇〞的悲惨星期四后
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.32,0:10:53.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...this is Friday night the way it was meant to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.32,0:10:53.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}星期五还是〝一成不变〞比较保险
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.28,0:10:56.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who's up for Sheldon-Free Saturday?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.28,0:10:56.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}来个〝禁止谢尔顿〞的星期六如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.95,0:11:01.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.95,0:11:01.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.16,0:11:02.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, Penny and Stuart.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.16,0:11:02.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你好 佩妮…和斯图尔特
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.08,0:11:05.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, Stuart.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.08,0:11:05.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}斯图尔特！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.62,0:11:07.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hey, guys. -So, what are you kids up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.62,0:11:07.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-大家好 -你们要去哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.96,0:11:10.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Stuart has a piece in an art show that's opening tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.96,0:11:10.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}斯图尔特有作品参加艺术展今晚开幕
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.75,0:11:14.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And you guys are going together. Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.75,0:11:14.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以你们联袂出席 太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.13,0:11:16.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It is great. Really great.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.13,0:11:16.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是很棒 真的很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.47,0:11:18.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's freaking awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.47,0:11:18.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}简直不可思议
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.10,0:11:20.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What are you doing? -Friday night.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.10,0:11:20.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你们要干嘛？ -今天星期五
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.97,0:11:23.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That means Chinese food and vintage video games?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.97,0:11:23.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}吃中国菜 玩经典电玩对吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.43,0:11:26.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Vintage doesn't even begin to describe what we have planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.43,0:11:26.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}〝经典〞还不足以形容 我们的精彩安排
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.52,0:11:31.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Tonight we are playing the classic 1980 interactive text adventure, "Zork."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.52,0:11:31.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}今晚我们要玩1980年 文字冒险游戏大作《魔域》
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.28,0:11:34.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's the buggy beta version.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.28,0:11:34.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还是有很多问题的测试版
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.03,0:11:36.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wow, "Zork."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.03,0:11:36.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}《魔域》
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.45,0:11:38.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Well, you guys have fun. -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.45,0:11:38.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-祝你们玩得开心 -好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.70,0:11:41.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}STUART: See you, guys. -See you, Stuart.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.70,0:11:41.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-大家再见 -再见 斯图尔特
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.16,0:11:42.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hey, Howard? -Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.16,0:11:42.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-霍华德 -怎么？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.91,0:11:46.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Take me to a bar with women.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.91,0:11:46.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}带我去有女人的酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.79,0:11:48.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Really? -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.79,0:11:48.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-真的？ -对
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.92,0:11:50.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.92,0:11:50.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.67,0:11:55.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let me just go inside and slip off my underwear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.67,0:11:55.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我先进去把内裤脱掉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.68,0:11:59.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.68,0:11:59.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.84,0:12:04.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}HOWARD: Well, if I get lucky, I don't wanna be caught in my Aquaman briefs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.84,0:12:04.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}万一有艳遇 我不要她发现 我穿〝海底人〞内裤
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.89,0:12:07.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you--? Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.89,0:12:07.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你也…一起脱吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.15,0:12:13.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[ROCK MUSIC PLAYING OVER SPEAKERS]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.57,0:12:17.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}May I have a grasshopper with a little umbrella, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.57,0:12:17.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}请给我一杯〝青草蜢〞 加一支小阳伞
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.40,0:12:19.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-No, he may not. -Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.40,0:12:19.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-不 别给他 -为何？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.74,0:12:24.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not sitting here with a guy drinking a grasshopper with a little umbrella.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.74,0:12:24.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不要跟喝〝青草蜢〞 加小阳伞的人坐在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.20,0:12:26.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.20,0:12:26.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.58,0:12:28.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll have a chocolate martini.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.58,0:12:28.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那给我〝巧克力马丁尼〞
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.29,0:12:30.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wrong again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.29,0:12:30.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}又错了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.21,0:12:36.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know I can't talk to women unless I'm lit up like the Hindu festival of Diwali.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.21,0:12:36.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在像印度〝排灯节〞般被点亮以前 我不敢跟女生说话
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.26,0:12:44.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There are plenty of bars where you can order grasshoppers or chocolate martinis...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.26,0:12:44.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在很多酒吧你都可以点 〝青草蜢〞或〝巧克力马丁尼〞
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.64,0:12:48.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but you wouldn't have to because there are no women in them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.64,0:12:48.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但没有必要 因为那里不会有女生
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.10,0:12:51.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.10,0:12:51.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}了解
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.85,0:12:54.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll have a Brandy Alexander.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.85,0:12:54.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}请给我〝白兰地亚历山大〞
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.23,0:12:58.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, the Three Musketeers just became the Dynamic Duo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.23,0:12:58.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 三剑客从此变成二人组
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.20,0:13:03.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Should we talk to some of these women? -No, it's way too early in the night for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.20,0:13:03.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我们该去跟女生说话吗？ -不 现在行动还太早
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.95,0:13:07.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}See, first we let the lawyers and the jocks thin the herd...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.95,0:13:07.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}先让律师和猛男把优等的挑走
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.16,0:13:10.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and then we go after the weak and the old and the lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.16,0:13:10.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们再进攻年老色衰有残缺的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.33,0:13:15.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-That's your system? -That's my system.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.33,0:13:15.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-这就是你的招？ -这就是我的招
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.92,0:13:19.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, and if you spot a chick with a Seeing Eye dog, she's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.92,0:13:19.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你若发现有个 牵导盲犬的女生 她是我的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.72,0:13:24.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.72,0:13:24.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别拗了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.05,0:13:29.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think it's nice that Captain Sweatpants showed up to your art opening.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.05,0:13:29.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我认为〝运动裤队长〞出席 你的艺术展开幕很贴心
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.18,0:13:33.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah. It would've been nicer if he hadn't touched all the cheese.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.18,0:13:33.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要是他没摸遍所有乳酪会更好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.73,0:13:38.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Um, you know, it's kind of early.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.73,0:13:38.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在时间还早
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.32,0:13:40.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wanna maybe come in for coffee or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.32,0:13:40.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你想进来喝杯咖啡吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.49,0:13:43.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, gee, it's a little late for coffee, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.49,0:13:43.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在喝咖啡有点晚了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.57,0:13:48.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, you think "coffee" means coffee. That is so sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.57,0:13:48.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你真的以为要喝咖啡 真可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.75,0:13:51.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on, I think I have decaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.75,0:13:51.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}来吧 我有无咖啡因的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.79,0:13:54.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, good, Stuart. I thought I heard your voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.79,0:13:54.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太好了 斯图尔特 果然是你的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.67,0:13:57.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Do you have a moment? -Uh, yeah, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.67,0:13:57.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-耽误你一下好吗？ -没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.34,0:13:58.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're a little busy here, so....
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.34,0:13:58.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 我们正好要忙…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.96,0:14:01.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What are you doing? -We're having coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.96,0:14:01.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-忙着做什么？ -喝点咖啡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.88,0:14:04.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Isn't it a little late for coffee?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.88,0:14:04.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在喝咖啡不嫌晚吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.88,0:14:07.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's okay. She thinks she has decaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.88,0:14:07.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没关系 她有无咖啡因的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.72,0:14:14.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll just go look for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.72,0:14:14.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我先去找一下
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.48,0:14:17.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What's up? -Well, I've spent the last three hours...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.48,0:14:17.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-什么事？ -我刚才花了三小时
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.19,0:14:20.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...in a debate in the DC Comics Batman chat room, and I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.19,0:14:20.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在DC漫画的蝙蝠侠聊天室 和人辩论 我需要你帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.73,0:14:24.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, yeah. Those guys can be very stubborn. What's the topic?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.73,0:14:24.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我懂 有些网友很死脑筋 什么主题？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.24,0:14:27.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I am asserting in the event that Batman's death proves permanent...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.24,0:14:27.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我坚持表明蝙蝠侠的死永远证明了…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.58,0:14:31.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...the original Robin, Dick Grayson, is the logical successor to the Bat Cowl.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.58,0:14:31.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}第一位罗宾：迪克格雷森 理应是蝙蝠面罩的继承人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.87,0:14:35.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ooh, Sheldon, I'm afraid you couldn't be more wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.87,0:14:35.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 很抱歉你错到极点了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.09,0:14:42.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"More wrong"?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.09,0:14:42.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}〝错到极点〞？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.01,0:14:48.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wrong is an absolute state and not subject to gradation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.01,0:14:48.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}〝错〞是一种绝对的状态 不能分等级的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.85,0:14:52.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Of course it is. It's a little wrong to say a tomato is a vegetable.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.85,0:14:52.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然可以 把蕃茄当蔬菜就是小错
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.35,0:14:55.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's very wrong to say it's a suspension bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.35,0:14:55.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}说蕃茄是吊桥就是大错
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.81,0:15:00.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But returning to the original issue, Dick Grayson became Nightwing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.81,0:15:00.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但言归正传 迪克格雷森后来成为〝夜翼〞
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.44,0:15:01.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A superhero in his own right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.44,0:15:01.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}本身就是超级英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.03,0:15:04.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Batman Two" has to be the second Robin, Jason Todd.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.03,0:15:04.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}《蝙蝠侠2》必须有 第二个罗宾：杰森托特
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.15,0:15:08.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Has to be"? "Has to be"?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.15,0:15:08.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}〝必须〞？〝必须有〞？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.45,0:15:11.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I hope you're being deliberately provocative.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.45,0:15:11.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}希望你是在刻意挑衅我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.16,0:15:14.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}PENNY: I found the decaf. -Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.16,0:15:14.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-找到无咖啡因咖啡了 -真棒
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.29,0:15:17.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, herbal tea for me, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.29,0:15:17.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 麻烦给我花草茶
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.96,0:15:23.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Barkeep, Alexander me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.96,0:15:23.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}酒保 再灌我一杯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.38,0:15:26.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How about those two?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.38,0:15:26.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那两位如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.18,0:15:28.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, they're eating peanuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.18,0:15:28.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不行 她们在吃花生
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.22,0:15:32.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}With my allergies, one kiss would put me in Cedars-Sinai for a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.22,0:15:32.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一旦接吻 我的过敏发作 铁定住院一星期
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.39,0:15:36.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What about the ones in the corner?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.39,0:15:36.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}角落那些呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.89,0:15:39.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Possible. Very possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.89,0:15:39.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有希望 很有希望
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.02,0:15:43.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You want the one in the whiplash collar or the one who keeps blinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.02,0:15:43.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要戴颈椎固定器的 还是一直眨眼睛的那位？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.32,0:15:47.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I think Blinky's cute. -Done, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.32,0:15:47.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-眨眼那个挺可爱的 -没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.57,0:15:49.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wait. So we just go over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.57,0:15:49.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等等 就这样上前吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.70,0:15:52.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. We have a little prep work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.70,0:15:52.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 我们得先预演一下
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.49,0:15:55.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Put this in your mouth, we walk past them, you stumble a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.49,0:15:55.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}把这个含着 经过她们身边时 假装跌倒
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.70,0:15:58.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I say, "Sorry, my friend's had a little too much."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.70,0:15:58.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我就说〝抱歉 我朋友喝多了〞
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.16,0:16:01.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And then I start to pull it out of your mouth and say:
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.16,0:16:01.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后把丝巾从你嘴里拉出来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.67,0:16:04.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"A little too much fun."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.67,0:16:04.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}并说〝我看他是玩疯了〞
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.42,0:16:05.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[LAUGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.84,0:16:09.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Get it? I mean, they're laughing, we're laughing. Then we get them up...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.84,0:16:09.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}懂吗？然后她们笑 我们也笑 并灌她们酒
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.43,0:16:13.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...to about a 0.15 blood alcohol level and tell them we're millionaires.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.43,0:16:13.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等她们酒精浓度达零点一五 再骗她们我们是百万富翁
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.18,0:16:16.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What else you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.18,0:16:16.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还有别的招吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.02,0:16:21.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Depends. Are you willing to sit on my lap and pretend to be a ventriloquist's dummy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.02,0:16:21.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你决定 你愿意坐我腿上 充当我的腹语娃娃吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.31,0:16:22.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.31,0:16:22.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不要
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.73,0:16:26.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't sit on your lap. You don't know the routine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.73,0:16:26.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不能坐你腿上 你不会铺梗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.36,0:16:32.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry, but you're obviously stuck in a pre-Zero Hour DC Universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.36,0:16:32.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉 我想你困在《终极动员令》 之前的DC宇宙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.78,0:16:36.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Of course I am. Removing Joe Chill as the killer of Batman's parents...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.78,0:16:36.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然 把乔奇尔当成杀蝙蝠侠 父母的凶手而除掉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.41,0:16:38.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...effectively deprived him of his raison d'être.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.41,0:16:38.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}根本剥夺了他的存在理由
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.79,0:16:43.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You can throw all the French around you want, it doesn't make you right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.79,0:16:43.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}随你怎么卖弄法语 你说的仍是错的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.63,0:16:45.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Au contraire.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.30,0:16:49.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Plus, you're forgetting that the Infinite Crisis story line...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.30,0:16:49.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}况且你忘了 《无限危机》的故事情节
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.72,0:16:52.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...restored Joe Chill to the Batman mythology.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.72,0:16:52.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}已让乔奇尔回到蝙蝠侠神话里
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.14,0:16:54.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I am forgetting nothing, and I resent your tone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.14,0:16:54.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我什么也没忘 而且你的口气很差
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.64,0:16:56.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SIGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.52,0:16:59.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. Look, Sheldon, it's late. I've gotta get some sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.52,0:16:59.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 谢尔顿 很晚了 我得回家睡觉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.06,0:17:02.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-So I win. -No, I'm tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.06,0:17:02.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-那我赢了 -不 是我累了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.27,0:17:05.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So I win.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.27,0:17:05.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以我赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.11,0:17:09.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Fine, you win. -Darn tooting, I win.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.11,0:17:09.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-好 算你赢 -我赢得彻底
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.95,0:17:13.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Penny, I really had a terrific time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.95,0:17:13.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮 我今晚很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.70,0:17:15.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Penny?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.70,0:17:15.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.49,0:17:17.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, no, no. Don't wake her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.49,0:17:17.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不…别叫醒她
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.54,0:17:20.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She'll maul you like a rabid wolverine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.54,0:17:20.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她会像发狂的金刚狼攻击你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.04,0:17:26.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, I don't think that was decaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.04,0:17:26.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那咖啡好像不是无咖啡因的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.30,0:17:32.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}HOWARD: Wait, is this your card or isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.30,0:17:32.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等一下 这张到底是不是你的牌？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.51,0:17:37.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Trust me, this was their card.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.51,0:17:37.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}相信我 是这张没错
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.85,0:17:39.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I thought you were good at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.85,0:17:39.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我以为你是高手
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.68,0:17:42.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're always talking about how you go to bars and meet women.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.68,0:17:42.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你老是说去酒吧认识女生的事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.94,0:17:44.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I do. All the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.94,0:17:44.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我有 家常便饭
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.60,0:17:47.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, what happened? Been sitting here all night...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.60,0:17:47.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是怎么了？我们坐了一晚
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.44,0:17:51.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and the longest conversation you've had with a woman was when your mom called.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.44,0:17:51.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你和女生讲最多的话 是你妈打给你时
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.62,0:17:59.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wow, you're just gonna make me come out and say it, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.62,0:17:59.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你真的要逼我说出来 是吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.70,0:18:00.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.70,0:18:00.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.04,0:18:03.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're weighing me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.04,0:18:03.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是你拖累了我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.42,0:18:08.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm a falcon who hunts better solo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.42,0:18:08.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是只猎鹰 适合单独行动
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.05,0:18:13.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fine, I'll sit here. You take flight and hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.05,0:18:13.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 我就坐在这 你尽管展翅猎食
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.55,0:18:17.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't be ridiculous. You can't just tell a falcon when to hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.55,0:18:17.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别荒唐了 你不能命令猎鹰何时出动
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.18,0:18:20.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Actually, you can.
